    <item>
      <title>Using Hugo</title>
      <link>https://kiranchavala.github.io/blog/using-hugo/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2020 16:26:27 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>https://kiranchavala.github.io/blog/using-hugo/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Hugo Requires Go&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;brew install hugo&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;create a folder for your website files&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;hugo server up  #It will generate a site locally on port 1313&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Install a theme and copy exampleSite/config.toml to the root folder&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;mkdir themes     // Creates a &amp;ldquo;themes&amp;rdquo; Folder
cd themes        // Points to the &amp;ldquo;themes&amp;rdquo; Folder
git submodule add &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/pacollins/hugo-future-imperfect-slim.git&#34;&gt;https://github.com/pacollins/hugo-future-imperfect-slim.git&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
